  <p>Summer is the season of effortless elegance. Here are the sleepwear trends we're loving right now.</p>
  
  <h2>1. Silk Slip Dresses</h2>
  <p>The classic silk slip never goes out of style. Lightweight, cool, and incredibly luxurious. Perfect for warm summer nights.</p>
  
  <h2>2. Cotton Modal Sets</h2>
  <p>Breathable, soft, and sustainable — cotton modal sets are the ultimate everyday summer sleepwear choice.</p>
  
  <h2>3. Pastel Tones</h2>
  <p>Blush pinks, lavender, and soft mint are dominating this summer's sleepwear palette. Gentle colors that soothe the senses.</p>
  
  <h2>4. Adjustable Strap Details</h2>
  <p>Thin, adjustable straps are everywhere. They allow for a customizable fit while adding a delicate, feminine touch.</p>
  
  <h2>5. Matching Sets</h2>
  <p>Coordinating top-and-short sets are practical and put-together. Great for lounging, sleeping, or even a quick coffee run.</p>
